  },
  {
    "char_end": 650,
    "char_start": 557,
    "end": 51.317,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01",
    "start": 44.014,
    "text": "I want to point something out – Inês Carvalho mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 749,
    "char_start": 651,
    "end": 59.008,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02",
    "start": 51.317,
    "text": "I want to point something out – Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 783,
    "char_start": 750,
    "end": 61.015,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s03",
    "start": 59.008,
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 843,
    "char_start": 784,
    "end": 64.602,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s04",
    "start": 61.015,
    "text": "What did you believe about this, and have you revisited it?",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 981,
    "char_start": 844,
    "end": 73.475,
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01",
    "start": 64.602,
    "text": "In short, most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1040,
    "char_start": 982,
    "end": 77.231,
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02",
    "start": 73.475,
    "text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1113,
    "char_start": 1041,
    "end": 81.894,
    "sent_id": "t0005.s03",
    "start": 77.231,
    "text": "The context matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1138,
    "char_start": 1114,
    "end": 83.661,
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01",
    "start": 81.894,
    "text": "It's a useful framework.",
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1197,
    "char_start": 1139,
    "end": 87.932,
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02",
    "start": 83.661,
    "text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1218,
    "char_start": 1198,
    "end": 89.26,
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01",
    "start": 87.932,
    "text": "That's how I see it.",
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1318,
    "char_start": 1219,
    "end": 95.831,
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02",
    "start": 89.26,
    "text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
